  "caveats": [
    "No designed runs in the data (all dropbacks). Run-fit threat is a PRE-SNAP PROXY (inline/wing share + defendersInBox residual); it is not observed run-fit value. Play-action share is reported (pa_share_*) but not in the score.",
    "Box residual is confounded with personnel (multi-TE sets) and game state beyond formation.",
    "Small sample: median ~10 RZ snaps per TE, few RZ targets; shrinkage dominates for most TEs and bootstrap CIs are wide. Treat rankings as descriptive, not a stable trait.",
    "Dirichlet smoothing pulls low-snap TEs toward league-level ambiguity (inflates RA for small n).",
    "Percentiles and z-scores are relative to this 2021 wk1-8 qualified pool only.",
    "Bootstrap holds league priors and reference fixed; it ignores between-play correlation within games."
  ],
  "runtime_s": 1.4
